Traveler Group will be divided into the <Highlight> Challenger Group </> (top eight) and subsequent <Highlight> Alliance Group </> (<Highlight> Alliance Group does not participate in promotion/relegation </>) based on <Highlight> total club Потусторонний rating </>. Before each league match, clubs in the Alliance Group will <Highlight> automatically match </> with other clubs to form an alliance and participate in the Four-Way League as an alliance. <Highlight> All club members </> in the alliance can enter the battlefield, and the <Highlight> President of the highest-ranked club </> in the alliance will automatically receive <Highlight> league command authority </> in the match. \n <img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Season Reset </> \n At the start of each new season, the league will <Highlight> re-divide divisions </>, and opponents will be re-matched to construct new divisions based on <Highlight> the previous season's league results </>. \n",
